				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;symptom-diagnosis--top-10-common-problems&#34;&gt;Symptom Diagnosis · Top 10 Common Problems&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#symptom-diagnosis--top-10-common-problems&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This interactive guide covers the &lt;strong&gt;10 most common embroidery machine problems&lt;/strong&gt;. Click a thumbnail to switch between different symptoms and view the corresponding diagnosis and solution.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;interactive-diagnosis&#34;&gt;Interactive Diagnosis&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#interactive-diagnosis&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;https://kimi2000nb.github.io/Symptom%20Diagnosis/Symptom%20Diagnosis.html&#34; width=&#34;100%&#34; height=&#34;700&#34; frameborder=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;border-radius:12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;top-10-common-problems&#34;&gt;Top 10 Common Problems&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#top-10-common-problems&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Ragged Thread Break&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Birdnesting&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Skipped Stitches&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Design Distortion&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Pull Compensation Issue&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Bobbin Thread Showing on Top&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Thread Trimming Failure&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Hopping / Jumping&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Needle Break&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Embroidery Too Close to Hat Brim&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thread Break / Thread Path Issue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
